WEBVTT

00:58:28.913 --> 00:58:30.454
for innovation we have in the world today.

00:58:31.621 --> 00:58:34.496
I talked a little bit about how
we combine these three.

00:58:36.579 --> 00:58:38.579
Different clans of research,

00:58:38.579 --> 00:58:39.913
engineering and sort of safety

00:58:39.913 --> 00:58:44.704
and policy that don't normally combine
well and I think we have

00:58:44.704 --> 00:58:47.996
an unusual strength, there were
clearly like well funded.

00:58:47.996 --> 00:58:49.329
We have super talented people.

00:58:49.663 --> 00:58:52.538
But what we really have
is like intense focus

00:58:52.538 --> 00:58:55.246
and self belief that what we're
doing is possible and good.

00:58:55.246 --> 00:58:57.996
And I appreciate the implied compliment.

00:58:58.704 --> 00:59:00.996
But, you know, we, like, work really hard.